## Input

```css
@import "wide-layout.css" screen and (min-width: 48rem);
@media (min-width: 40rem), (aspect-ratio: 16 / 9) {}
@media (width: calc(100px + 1rem)) {}
@container (width >= 20rem) {}
@container scroll-state(stuck: top) {}
@supports (display: grid) {}
.control { width: if(media(width >= 30rem): 1px; else: 2px); }
@media (calc(20rem + 1px) < width) {}

```


